{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time unrolled recurrent network time unrolled recurrent network","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","fileName":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 02:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Recurrent Sequence Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recurrent Sequence Architecture","Recurrent Neural Network","Backpropagation Through Time","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time unrolled recurrent network time unrolled recurrent network","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","fileName":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network","heading":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Unrolling a [[Recurrent Neural Network]] through time draws its repeated computation as a sequence of hidden and output layers, one set for each input step. The hidden state produced at one step becomes part of the input to the next. This drawing exposes the dependency chain that the compact recurrent loop conceals.\n\nThe apparent many-layer network does not learn independent parameters for every drawn step: the recurrent connections reuse the same weights. Unrolling makes [[Backpropagation Through Time]] easier to understand because an error at a later output must travel backward through the earlier states that influenced it.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recurrent Sequence Architecture","Recurrent Neural Network","Backpropagation Through Time","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time unrolled recurrent network time unrolled recurrent network","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","fileName":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time-Unrolled Recurrent Network","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[deeplearning_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recurrent Sequence Architecture","Recurrent Neural Network","Backpropagation Through Time","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}